(114237,'CANCEL_SUBSCRIPTION_SUB_CONTENT','ui','en','<p>After that, you will be limited to 5GB and will not be able to <br>upload new documents.</p>\n\n<p>You will still have access to your data for <span class=\'text-blue\'> 180 days </span><br>before it is <span class=\'text-alert\'>deleted </span>forever.</p>'),
(114238,'CANCEL_SUBSCRIPTION_SUB_CONTENT','ui','fr','<p>Après cela, vous serez limité à 5 Go et ne pourrez plus <br>télécharger de nouveaux documents.</p>\n\n<p>Vous aurez toujours accès à vos données pendant <span class=\'text-blue\'> 180 jours </span><br>avant qu\'elles ne soient <span class=\'text-alert\'>supprimées </span>pour toujours.</ p>\n'),
(114239,'CANCEL_SUBSCRIPTION_SUB_CONTENT','ui','km','<p>បន្ទាប់​ពី​នោះ អ្នក​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​កំណត់​ត្រឹម 5GB ហើយ​នឹង​មិន​អាច<br>បង្ហោះ​ឯកសារ​ថ្មី​បាន​ទេ។</p>\n\n<p>អ្នកនឹងនៅតែអាចចូលប្រើទិន្នន័យរបស់អ្នកសម្រាប់ <span class=\'text-blue\'> 180 ថ្ងៃ</span><br>មុនពេលវាត្រូវបាន <span class=\'text-alert\'>បានលុប</span>ជារៀងរហូត .</p>'),
(114240,'CANCEL_SUBSCRIPTION_SUB_CONTENT','ui','ru','<p>После этого вы будете ограничены 5 ГБ и не сможете<br>загружать новые документы.</p>\n\n<p>У вас по-прежнему будет доступ к вашим данным в течение <span class=\'text-blue\'> 180 дней </span><br>до того, как они будут <span class=\'text-alert\'>удалены </span>навсегда. .</p>'),
(114241,'CANCEL_SUBSCRIPTION_SUB_CONTENT','ui','zh','<p>之后，您将被限制为 5GB，并且将无法<br>上传新文档。</p>\n\n<p>您仍然可以在 <span class=\'text-blue\'> 180 天内访问您的数据</span><br>在它被<span class=\'text-alert\'>永久删除</span>之前 .</p>'),
(114242,'SUBSCRIPTION_CHANGED_ACK','ui','en','<p>Your Subscription changed successfully.</p>\n<br>\n<p>Your new validity is {0}.</p>'),
