(114527,'_subscription_expired_message','server','en','Your Drumee ‘Pro’ Subscription has been expired. You are now move to Drumee Advanced plan which is limited to 5 Gb storage.\n\nIf your existing data storage is above 5 Gb, you will not be able to create, send or receive files, neither synchronize it with your computer.\n\nDon’t worry though, your files will be safe and stay for your access up to 180 days. You can be able to view/download/delete files.\n\nYou can always restart your subscription during this 180 days to enjoy the benefits of Drumee `Pro` again.'),
(114528,'_subscription_expired_message','server','fr','Votre abonnement Pro a expiré. Vous avez été remis sur un abonnement gratuit Drumee Advanced, limité à 5 Go.  \n\nTant que votre volume de fichiers dépassera ce quota vous ne pourrez pas créer, envoyer, recevoir des fichiers ni synchroniser de nouveau des fichiers avec votre ordinateur.\n\nCependant vos fichiers resteront accessible pendant 6 mois et vous pourrez toujours les lire, les télécharger et les supprimer. \n\nSi vous souhaitez vite reprendre votre abonnement Pro et tout restaurer allez sur la page de paiement en cliquant sur le lien:'),
(114529,'_subscription_expired_message','server','km','Your Drumee ‘Pro’ Subscription has been expired. You are now move to Drumee Advanced plan which is limited to 5 Gb storage.\n\nIf your existing data storage is above 5 Gb, you will not be able to create, send or receive files, neither synchronize it with your computer.\n\nDon’t worry though, your files will be safe and stay for your access up to 180 days. You can be able to view/download/delete files.\n\nYou can always restart your subscription during this 180 days to enjoy the benefits of Drumee `Pro` again.'),
(114530,'_subscription_expired_message','server','ru','Your Drumee ‘Pro’ Subscription has been expired. You are now move to Drumee Advanced plan which is limited to 5 Gb storage.\n\nIf your existing data storage is above 5 Gb, you will not be able to create, send or receive files, neither synchronize it with your computer.\n\nDon’t worry though, your files will be safe and stay for your access up to 180 days. You can be able to view/download/delete files.\n\nYou can always restart your subscription during this 180 days to enjoy the benefits of Drumee `Pro` again.'),
(114531,'_subscription_expired_message','server','zh','Your Drumee ‘Pro’ Subscription has been expired. You are now move to Drumee Advanced plan which is limited to 5 Gb storage.\n\nIf your existing data storage is above 5 Gb, you will not be able to create, send or receive files, neither synchronize it with your computer.\n\nDon’t worry though, your files will be safe and stay for your access up to 180 days. You can be able to view/download/delete files.\n\nYou can always restart your subscription during this 180 days to enjoy the benefits of Drumee `Pro` again.'),
